<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia April broad money M3 up 19.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Malaysia April broad money M3 up 19.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's broad money M3 expanded by 19.7 percent year-on-year in April, against 21.0 percent in March, the central Bank Negara said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Total annual loans growth stood at 28.5 percent at the end of April against 29.6 percent at the end of March, it said.  </p>
<p>	   MALAYSIA MONETARY AGGREGATES:</p>
<p>(Percentage change at end of period, year-on-year)</p>
<p>	   April 97	 March 97	April 96</p>
<p>  M1	 11.7	     18.9	    17.0</p>
<p>  M2	 17.6	     20.8	    27.9</p>
<p>  M3	 19.7	     21.0	    27.0</p>
<p>Note: M1 - money in circulation and cash on deposit in banks</p>
<p>	 M2 - M1 plus time, savings and foreign currency deposits</p>
<p>	 M3 - broad money</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
